0-4853-81b4-e8d4d78419d5" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Metropolitan Transit Authority Revenue Collection Process, March 1, 2018</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-12/MetroTransitAuthorityProcureToPay_120810_InternalAuditReport.pdf?ct=1765835577" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="60227d7e-5a5c-450d-a435-03ccfc5be23f" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Metropolitan Transit Authority Procure to Pay Process, August 10, 2012</a></li></ul><h2>Hotel Occupancy Tax Audits</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-12/20190201HotelAuditReportFY2019.pdf?ct=1766416958" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="556c3e60-05b7-4111-8fe6-d62547fe2883" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Hotel Occupancy Tax Audit Summary July 2016 to January 2019</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-11/20160721HotelAuditReportFY2016.pdf?ct=1762811554" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="6514725e-b96c-4404-88fe-93ec4b46378c" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Hotel Occupancy Tax for FY 2016</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-11/20150709HotelAuditsFY2015.pdf?ct=1762958460" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="efe12ad9-60dc-43f2-9ed7-ffbcc7d93cff" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Metro Nashville Hotel Occupancy Tax Audit Fiscal Year 2015</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-12/2040917HotelSummaryFY2014.pdf?ct=1765921996" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="338de257-8e11-4fef-9a75-81178ebbf6ce" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Hotel Occupancy Tax Audit Summary FY2014</a></li><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-11/HotelAuditReportFiscalYear20130822.pdf?ct=1762965095" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="59975f3e-d55f-4fa2-b18d-01096d6f8590" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Hotel Occupancy Taxes - Fiscal Year 2013</a></li></ul><h2>Boards and Commissions</h2><ul><li><a href="/sites/default/files/2025-11/20160131HealthEducationalFacilitiesBoardFinalReport.pdf?ct=1762791398" data-entity-type="media